WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:01.960
AJA HAMMERLY: Welcome
to Cloud Minute.

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.420
Today I'm going to show you
how to enable and disable

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.000
APIs on Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.800
If you are trying
to use a GCP product

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.200
but are receiving an
unauthorized error,

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.540
you should double-check
that the API is enabled.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.480
On GCP you have to enable the
API that you want your project

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:17.380
to use.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:21.340
From Google Cloud console,
click API Manager and then

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.980
Enable API.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.320
You can search for the
API you need to enable.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:30.340
I'm enabling the Cloud
Natural Language API.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.520
On the details page you can see
more information about the API,

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:39.550
access the documentation, or
enable or disable the API.

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:42.690
Once it is enabled I can
use the API from my code.

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:45.630
I can also see information
about my usage and any errors

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:48.260
I've received on this page.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:51.360
If you want to see all the
APIs in use on your project,

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:53.880
click on the dashboard.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.770
If you need to disable
any of these APIs,

00:00:55.770 --> 00:00:58.020
you can do that from here.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.920
That's it.

